WEBVTT

00:07:25.387 --> 00:07:30.046
That was programming in the early 1960s.

00:07:31.566 --> 00:07:36.701
In 1975, 13 years from startup,

00:07:36.701 --> 00:07:39.912
equal opportunity legislation 
came in in Britain

00:07:39.912 --> 00:07:46.824
and that made it illegal to have 
our pro-female policies.

00:07:46.824 --> 00:07:50.400
And as an example of 
unintended consequences,

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.072
my female company had to let the men in.

00:07:54.072 --> 00:07:59.014
(Laughter)

00:07:59.014 --> 00:08:01.418
When I started my company of women,